---
title: "5.5 State — status langganan per website"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> pending: order website dibuat
  pending --> active: lunas
  active --> active: perpanjang sebelum H / perubahan terjadwal diterapkan
  active --> berhenti: pelanggan berhenti
  berhenti --> active: batal berhenti / bayar
  active --> grace: H lewat tanpa bayar
  grace --> active: lunas ≤ H+7
  grace --> suspended: H+8
  berhenti --> suspended: H (tanpa tenggang)
  suspended --> active: lunas sebelum H+30
  suspended --> expired: H+30
  expired --> [*]
  pending: pending<br/>belum lunas
  active: active<br/>tayang, bisa diedit
  berhenti: active + berhenti<br/>tayang sampai H
  grace: grace<br/>tayang, editor hanya-baca (H+1 s.d. H+7)
  suspended: suspended<br/>website nonaktif 503 (H+8 s.d. H+29)
  expired: expired<br/>isi dihapus, kursi dilepas
  note right of suspended
    Tangguhan admin di tenants.status / sites.status
    mengalahkan semua status langganan (RB-11)
  end note
  classDef ok fill:#DCE6F7,stroke:#1F3864,color:#1A1A1A
  classDef warn fill:#FFF2CC,stroke:#B7791F,color:#1A1A1A
  classDef bad fill:#FBE4E4,stroke:#B03A2E,color:#1A1A1A
  classDef gone fill:#E5E5E5,stroke:#718096,color:#1A1A1A
  class active,berhenti ok
  class grace warn
  class suspended bad
  class expired gone
